            <title>[IGNITE-2587] Unexpected exception during cache update</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2587</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;1. Start server node&lt;br/&gt;
