                            <comment id="15138562" author="sboikov" created="Tue, 9 Feb 2016 09:00:32 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Investigated, there are two issues:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;temporary object created over offheap pointer (BinaryObjectOffheapImpl) is not unwrapped in OFFHEAP_VALUES mode&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;for OFFHEAP_VALUES, OFFHEAP_TIERED modes old value is not always deserialized for continous query&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Need to add continous query tests for OFFHEAP_VALUES, OFFHEAP_TIERED modes, also tests should use not only primitive keys/values,&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15140639" author="sboikov" created="Wed, 10 Feb 2016 11:13:07 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hi Sergey,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue is fixed in &apos;master&apos; branch (commit 4c05fc0), could you verify?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thanks!&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
